 "ez_index": 92,
 "name": "ST01EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "The people of space are fragile.",
  "Humans are not built",
  "to live in space.",
  "Separating people from space,",
  "the outer walls of a space colony",
  "were, to save on materials,",
  "made as thin as they could be.",
  "They had no armor to begin with,",
  "and in war they broke easily.",
  "A colony, a giant 30 km long,",
  "was never damaged so badly",
  "that its shape changed, but",
  "there was no need for that:",
  "people died easily.",
  "Putting a hole in a colony",
  "was enough.",
  "Shoot at a colony with long-range",
  "weapons from extreme range, and",
  "the people of space soon give in.",
  "Before the war, to keep control",
  "of the people of space, the Earth",
  "Federation devised the grand fleet",
  "concept: space battleships and",
  "cruisers built in vast numbers.",
  "Then came Universal Century 0079.",
  "That thinking",
  "would be betrayed",
  "by the mobile suit.",
  "Char, the Red Comet",
  "Amuro Ray",
  "Char was a man of passion.",
  "He never held, from first to last,",
  "political ideals in the true sense.",
  "Completing revenge for the father",
  "he believed the Zabis killed, and",
  "fulfilling his longing for his mother:",
  "these alone he carried through.",
  "His life as himself",
  "had probably ended long before",
  "he stepped onto history's stage.",
  "In history, there was",
  "only an avenger.",
  "Ashamed of his vengeance, he wore",
  "a mask to hide who he was,",
  "and as a pilot known by the name",
  "of the \"Red Comet,\"",
  "he won renown for his valor.",
  "The superior of Zeon officer",
  "Char Aznable at that time",
  "was a man named Dozle Zabi.",
  "He was one of the Zabis, who had",
  "murdered Zeon Zum Deikun, father",
  "of Char--that is, of Casval--",
  "and Char, fighting under him,",
  "awaited his chance at revenge.",
  "Killing one man alone",
  "would not complete his revenge.",
  "Alone, Char meant to destroy",
  "the Zabi family in all its glory.",
  "Aboard the Musai",
  "Dozle",
  "\"Last night, I tell you,",
  " I was planning to celebrate",
  " the end of your mission!\"",
  "\"Thanks to your dawdling,",
  " the whole banquet I'd laid on",
  " went to waste! Well?\"",
  "Char",
  "\"We've caught wind of",
  " the Federation's Operation V,",
  " Vice Admiral Dozle.\"",
  "\"What? Operation V?\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"At Side 7, we detected both",
  " mobile suit development and",
  " a new warship to go with it, sir.\"",
  "\"So Intelligence does",
  " decent work once in a while.\"",
  "\"Well, now,",
  " just what I'd expect",
  " of Char, the Red Comet!\"",
  "\"So, what is it?\"",
  "\"As we were on our way back,",
  " our missiles and ammunition",
  " are all spent, and...\"",
  "\"You want supplies, eh?",
  " I'll send them.\"",
  "\"Much obliged.",
  " Also, three replacement Zakus.\"",
  "\"You lost three",
  " Zaku mobile suits?\"",
  "\"Yes, Vice Admiral.\"",
  "\"Two of them were lost",
  " to just a single",
  " Federation mobile suit.\"",
  "\"Mmh...",
  " Very well, I'll send the Zakus.\"",
  "\"Any data on Operation V will do.",
  " Make sure you get it.\"",
  "\"If you can, capture",
  " that mobile suit itself.\"",
  "\"I shall try.\"",
  "\"Good.\"",
  "That Amuro, not yet enlisted,",
  "piloted a mobile suit,",
  "fought an enemy mobile suit",
  "and destroyed it,",
  "is an open secret of history.",
  "A civilian handling weapons,",
  "or engaging in acts of war,",
  "was a problem under the law.",
  "Today, the matter is settled",
  "as legitimate self-defense,",
  "an act to protect himself,",
  "but the Federation looked bad,",
  "so it turned back the clock",
  "and recorded that, the day before",
  "he first boarded a mobile suit,",
  "he enlisted and was accepted.",
  "Aboard White Base",
  "Paolo",
  "\"What?",
  " Who did you say",
  " is piloting the Gundam?\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"He said his name was Amuro.\"",
  "\"Never heard of him.\"",
  "\"Perhaps a pilot running tests",
  " at Side 7?\"",
  "\"I don't recall him.",
  " Get him on the line.\"",
  "\"Mirai-kun, how does it look?\"",
  "Mirai",
  "\"I understand the basic controls.",
  " But the engine control...\"",
  "\"Ryu-kun will find someone for you.",
  " If even one of them comes back,",
  " we can manage.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"Forgive me. There is no one left",
  " aboard who can handle this ship.\"",
  "\"I've reached him... Huh?\"",
  "\"Y-you're Amuro?",
  " You're in the Gundam's",
  " cockpit, aren't you?\"",
  "\"What is it?\"",
  "\"It's a child.",
  " A-a child is piloting",
  " the Gundam.\"",
  "\"...What?\"",
  "\"Huh? Then this Amuro is...\"",
  "\"Would you care to see, sir?",
  " This boy, in the Gundam.\"",
  "\"H-he's no pilot.\"",
  "\"What is the meaning of this?",
  " A child operating the Gundam?\"",
  "\"...If it's that boy, then maybe.\"",
  "\"You know him?\"",
  "\"Not well.",
  " But on Side 7 he was well known",
  " as a boy who loves machines.\"",
  "\"Was it that boy, too,",
  " who brought down Zeon's Zaku?\"",
  "Mirai Yashima, then a civilian,",
  "and on record as having enlisted",
  "at the same time as Amuro,",
  "remembered young Amuro",
  "as a somewhat",
  "unusual character.",
  "To begin with,",
  "Mirai Yashima's perception",
  "was so far beyond the ordinary",
  "that some theorize",
  "she was a Newtype herself,",
  "so perhaps she had seen",
  "through to Amuro's abilities.",
  "Or it may be that Amuro,",
  "even before the war, was",
  "someone everyone already",
  "recognized as exceptional.",
  "Someone who, in his first ride",
  "in a mobile suit, beat two enemies,",
  "and no one thought",
  "it at all strange--",
  "he may have been such a person.",
  "And yet this hero like no other,",
  "triumphant from his first battle,",
  "was, beyond anyone's imagining,",
  "a boy with nothing in particular",
  "to make him stand out.",
  "At this point, Bright",
  "was badly shaken.",
  "\"Another attack, it seems.\"",
  "\"And Amuro's punishment--",
  " what will you do about it,",
  " Captain?\"",
  "\"Operator, where's the enemy?\"",
  "Marker",
  "\"Sir! Aft, 40 degrees to port,",
  " one Musai-type, same as before,",
  " closing in.\"",
  "\"There will be no punishment.",
  " He's a valuable fighting asset.",
  " Worth bowing my head to ask, hm.\"",
  "\"...Have him get rid of every",
  " Gundam part that we can't use.\"",
  "\"Have a beam rifle readied",
  " for the Gundam.\"",
  "\"Sir?\"",
  "\"He's a little young for battle,",
  " but since olden days, going to war",
  " at 15 or 16 was not unheard of.\"",
  "\"Yes, Captain.\"",
  "\"Amuro, can you hear me?",
  " Destroy the Gundam parts",
  " left behind on Side 7.\"",
  "Amuro",
  "\"Why?",
  " Still about 3 units' worth...\"",
  "\"You'd hand Zeon",
  " our military secrets?\"",
  "\"That's odd.",
  " The Musai has pulled back.\"",
  "\"Pulled back?\"",
  "\"Do you know how to do it?\"",
  "\"I-if I use that stuff,",
  " the super napalm...\"",
  "\"Captain.\"",
  "\"Amuro-kun's judgment is sound.",
  " Leave it to him. Blast Zeon,",
  " they must be planning something.\"",
  "Though mortally wounded,",
  "Captain Paolo",
  "made emergency repairs to his ship",
  "and took command,",
  "trying somehow to overcome",
  "this hopeless situation.",
  "That even at this stage",
  "he still meant",
  "to keep fighting",
  "reveals his character",
  "and his sense of responsibility.",
  "He was a man many could respect,",
  "a fine soldier.",
  "Even so, had it only been",
  "a matter of delivering",
  "the prototypes to friendly forces,",
  "he would not have gone",
  "to such lengths.",
  "A soldier always has the option",
  "to \"surrender.\"",
  "That he could not do so",
  "was because he could not",
  "trust the enemy.",
  "Many civilians had already",
  "been killed or wounded,",
  "and for him, surrender was",
  "no longer an option.",
  "Nor did the civilians, for their part,",
  "ever call for surrender.",
  "If you do not trust the enemy,",
  "surrender is simply not possible.",
  "Char, meanwhile, having lost",
  "two Zakus,",
  "reasoned that so strong an enemy",
  "was unlikely to surrender,",
  "and so he had not bothered",
  "to call on them to do so.",
  "As a result, this misunderstanding",
  "would start the second round",
  "of the battle.",
  "With so few surviving crew,",
  "controlling the ship was impossible.",
  "Paolo had been running the ship",
  "with his few crew, all controls",
  "centralized on the bridge. But",
  "once the bridge was hit and he",
  "was badly hurt himself, that setup",
  "had completely backfired.",
  "But even so, Paolo",
  "had not given up.",
  "He dosed himself with painkillers,",
  "shortening his own life,",
  "and now gathered even civilians",
  "under his protection to carry out",
  "an escape operation.",
  "Things were already long past",
  "anything like punishing Amuro.",
  "The battle began again.",
  "Having fled the only",
  "space colony in Side 7",
  "with civilians aboard,",
  "White Base would now",
  "have to fight, to protect itself",
  "and to protect the civilians",
  "in its care.",
  "\"Calling Amuro-kun in the Gundam.\"",
  "\"Y-yes, sir.\"",
  "\"You appear to be too far",
  " from White Base.\"",
  "\"Position yourself 10 kilometers",
  " to this ship's starboard, please.\"",
  "\"Roger.\"",
  "the outer walls of a space colony",
  "were, by cosmic measure, very thin.",
  "the people of space easily perish.",
  "A space colony",
  "cannot dodge.",
  "So the moment the Zeon cruiser",
  "was spotted, it was only natural",
  "that an Earth Federation ship",
  "fled Side 7 packed with residents,",
  "both to survive",
  "and to protect those residents.",
  "And now another matter of course",
  "was about to take place.",
  "\"One of the Zaku is",
  " closing at three times",
  " the normal speed.\"",
  "\"Ch-Char...",
  " I-it's the Red Comet.\"",
  "\"Sir? Captain, what is it?\"",
  "\"What? Char the Red Comet?\"",
  "\"At the Battle of Loum, Char",
  " alone destroyed five battleships.",
  " ...R-run.\"",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "\"Let me see just how good",
  " this Federation mobile suit",
  " really is.\"",
  "Before the war, the star players",
  "of war the Earth Federation built",
  "to govern the people of space--",
  "space battleships and cruisers--",
  "faced colonies or other ships.",
  "In Universal Century 0079,",
  "those stars were dragged down",
  "from center stage.",
  "The mobile suit.",
  "Next to a battleship, a mere",
  "18-meter humanoid weapon",
  "was the new star.",
  "A colony, like an enemy battleship,",
  "had next to no mobility.",
  "Any thinking geared to mobility",
  "did not yet exist back then.",
  "And for that very reason,",
  "the mobile suit Zaku",
  "became an invincible presence.",
  "If it does not hit,",
  "no weapon, however large,",
  "means a thing.",
  "The Federation had mobile weapons",
  "of this kind too, if not humanoid,",
  "but being even smaller",
  "than mobile suits,",
  "they had severe range problems,",
  "and their use was confined",
  "to roles like base defense.",
  "In the end,",
  "the mobile suit",
  "was a well-balanced,",
  "general-purpose weapon.",
  "Not too large, it was agile;",
  "not too small, its missions",
  "need not be limited",
  "to base defense alone.",
  "By comparison, in fleet battles",
  "the mobile suit was invincible,",
  "and that was now about to give",
  "rise to something new.",
  "\"Stop, Amuro. You're not yet--\"",
  "\"Can you get away in that ship?\"",
  "\"That's...\"",
  "\"Amuro-kun is right.",
  " Only a mobile suit",
  " can fight a mobile suit.\"",
  "\"Isn't that the lesson our forces",
  " have been learning all along?\"",
  "\"I'll do it.\"",
  "\"Send out support.\"",
  "The battle was won.",
  "But the enemy would resupply",
  "and regroup soon enough,",
  "and the nearest allies were still",
  "several days away.",
  "Inevitably, the setup of a few",
  "soldiers, many civilians,",
  "and still more refugees--",
  "a ship run by civilians--",
  "would carry on just as it was.",
  "Amuro, still not enlisted,",
  "served as a pilot.",
  "Like Amuro, a civilian",
  "from Side 7,",
  "Mirai Yashima,",
  "a young lady of a ruined family,",
  "had experience sailing yachts,",
  "and so she became the helmsman.",
  "Kai Shiden,",
  "Hayato Kobayashi,",
  "Sayla Mass,",
  "and many others in this way",
  "began to work",
  "as members of the crew.",
  "The journey of hardship",
  "had now begun."
 ]
}
